### 외부 게시글 조회 (RestClient)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 성공 — 외부 서버 실제 응답(고정값 아님)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reference/posts/1
Accept: application/json

### 형식 오류 — 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reference/posts/abc
Accept: application/json

### 범위 오류 — postId < 1 → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reference/posts/0
Accept: application/json

### 외부 404 — REFERENCE_POST_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reference/posts/999999
Accept: application/json
